R08 conclusion: `conclusion_type` in {"open_problem","formal_model","conditional_theorem"}; `conclusion` str non-empty; must match regex for negation-of-visibility: contains one of ["no naked", "not visible", "hidden from", "i+ is complete", "future null infinity is complete", "no future-directed causal curve"]; and must NOT contain ["maximal development exists","there exists a development","converges","numerical evidence","proves","proof"]. Also forbid conclusion_type "theorem"/"counterexample"/"numerical_evidence"/"stability_result".

