R10 falsifier: dict with `witness_type` non-empty and `test` non-empty str; not in {"none","n/a","not applicable",""}; also `test` length >= 20 maybe.

R11 evidence_refs: list non-empty; each dict with `kind` in {"internal_file","primary_source","definition"}; `locator` non-empty; if kind primary_source then `verification_status` in {"verified","unresolved"} and if "unresolved" add WARN (not fail) — report under warnings.

