Thomas algorithm:
```python
def thomas(a, b, c, d):  # a sub, b diag, c super, d rhs
    m=len(d); cp=np.empty(m); dp=np.empty(m)
    cp[0]=c[0]/b[0]; dp[0]=d[0]/b[0]
    for i in range(1,m):
        denom=b[i]-a[i]*cp[i-1]
        cp[i]=c[i]/denom
        dp[i]=(d[i]-a[i]*dp[i-1])/denom
    x=np.empty(m); x[-1]=dp[-1]
    for i in range(m-2,-1,-1): x[i]=dp[i]-cp[i]*x[i+1]
    return x
```
